        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/896a00264712170d5cc842e32bc8c874.poster.avif?t=1776168949\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/896a00264712170d5cc842e32bc8c874.webm?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT THE CLOCK, TAME HER WRATH, SAVE THE DAY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a woman gets angry, the world trembles—windows shatter, volcanoes erupt, and people cower in fear! It’s your job to save the world by taming her tantrums. In this fast-paced puzzle game, you race against the clock to arrange comic-style illustrations using subtle hints, piecing together the chain of events that sparked each meltdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game like no other - blending sharp humor with clever mechanics. With comic-book flair, pin-up sass, and beautifully animated sequences, the game drops you into a gallery of scenarios that are sometimes hilariously absurd, sometimes uncomfortably relatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s part puzzle-solving, part comedy of errors - a mix that keeps you guessing, laughing, and sometimes cringing at just how familiar it all feels. A perfect icebreaker game - entertaining not just for players, but also for anyone watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/feb11a1c477f1b34654a5b93d3f9ec7d.poster.avif?t=1776168949\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/feb11a1c477f1b34654a5b93d3f9ec7d.webm?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/feb11a1c477f1b34654a5b93d3f9ec7d.mp4?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fast-paced puzzle gameplay: </strong>under a ticking clock, decode the hints, line up the illustrations, and watch the tantrum take shape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ hilarious tantrum scenarios</strong> from absurd misunderstandings to relatable everyday conflicts - spanning date nights, family matters, parties, gaming nights and plenty more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd yet painfully relatable situations</strong> that will make you either howl from secondhand embarrassment or laugh at their sheer stupidity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three distinct playable characters</strong>, each with their own quirks, personality, and tantrum triggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced humor</strong>: lightheartedly pokes fun at stereotypes for both men and women.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish visuals</strong> blending comic book flair with retro pin-up aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully animated comic book sequences</strong> that bring every meltdown to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden ending</strong>: sometimes even failure has a silver lining - your choices and “mistakes” can unlock unexpected outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/34b61f3c8236780d0088b93518ad85ea.poster.avif?t=1776168949\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/34b61f3c8236780d0088b93518ad85ea.webm?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/896a00264712170d5cc842e32bc8c874.poster.avif?t=1776168949\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/896a00264712170d5cc842e32bc8c874.webm?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT THE CLOCK, TAME HER WRATH, SAVE THE DAY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a woman gets angry, the world trembles—windows shatter, volcanoes erupt, and people cower in fear! It’s your job to save the world by taming her tantrums. In this fast-paced puzzle game, you race against the clock to arrange comic-style illustrations using subtle hints, piecing together the chain of events that sparked each meltdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game like no other - blending sharp humor with clever mechanics. With comic-book flair, pin-up sass, and beautifully animated sequences, the game drops you into a gallery of scenarios that are sometimes hilariously absurd, sometimes uncomfortably relatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s part puzzle-solving, part comedy of errors - a mix that keeps you guessing, laughing, and sometimes cringing at just how familiar it all feels. A perfect icebreaker game - entertaining not just for players, but also for anyone watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/feb11a1c477f1b34654a5b93d3f9ec7d.poster.avif?t=1776168949\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/feb11a1c477f1b34654a5b93d3f9ec7d.webm?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/feb11a1c477f1b34654a5b93d3f9ec7d.mp4?t=1776168949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fast-paced puzzle gameplay: </strong>under a ticking clock, decode the hints, line up the illustrations, and watch the tantrum take shape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ hilarious tantrum scenarios</strong> from absurd misunderstandings to relatable everyday conflicts - spanning date nights, family matters, parties, gaming nights and plenty more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd yet painfully relatable situations</strong> that will make you either howl from secondhand embarrassment or laugh at their sheer stupidity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three distinct playable characters</strong>, each with their own quirks, personality, and tantrum triggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced humor</strong>: lightheartedly pokes fun at stereotypes for both men and women.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish visuals</strong> blending comic book flair with retro pin-up aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully animated comic book sequences</strong> that bring every meltdown to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden ending</strong>: sometimes even failure has a silver lining - your choices and “mistakes” can unlock unexpected outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048160/extras/34b61f3c8236780d0088b93518ad85ea.poster.avif?t=1776168949\" width=1170 h